## corpus/memory/raw_compound_assign.lu
//! check: run(exit=0, stdout="8\n248\n12\n")
//! phase: run
//! conforms: mem.unsafe.raw.1, gram.expr.assign
//!
//! kw01 (wolf-lang#542, a silent wrong answer on three lanes): `p[i]
//! op= v` through a raw pointer is a read-modify-write at the pointee's
